(5264,'The Breakpoint module keeps track of the height, width, and resolution breakpoints where a responsive design needs to change in order to respond to different devices being used to view the site. This module does not have a user interface. For more information, see the <a href=\":docs\">online documentation for the Breakpoint module</a>.','','none'),
